agsdict:WGPT
    a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary> ;
    skos:altLabel "WGPT"@en ;
    skos:definition "Wireline Geophysics - Readings"@en ;
    skos:historyNote """Group status: New
AGS 4.1: Group Added
AGS 4.1: Headings Added - LOCA_ID, WGPG_ID, WGPG_TOOL, WGPG_PARA, WGPG_UNIT, WGPT_DPTH, WGPT_RDNG, WGPT_CAS, WGPT_REM, FILE_FSET""" ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary> ;
    skos:narrower
        agsdict:FILE_FSET ,
        agsdict:LOCA_ID ,
        agsdict:WGPG_ID ,
        agsdict:WGPG_TOOL ,
        agsdict:WGPT_CAS ,
        agsdict:WGPT_DPTH ,
        agsdict:WGPT_PARA ,
        agsdict:WGPT_RDNG ,
        agsdict:WGPT_REM ,
        agsdict:WGPT_UNIT ;
    skos:notation "WGPT"^^xsd:token ;
    skos:prefLabel "Wireline Geophysics - Readings"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote
        """Group rules: Where a reading has no unit, the WGPT_UNIT data shall be set to "UNITLESS".
Units included in WGPT_UNIT shall be fully defined in the UNIT group (Rule 15), the unit group is case sensitive.
Data type for data field heading WGPT_UNIT shall not be changed from PU."""@en ,
        """WGPT_CAS defines if the reading was carried out in open hole, cased hole, PVC cased. Example of WGPT_CAS include: OH = Open hole; CH = Cased hole; PVC = PVC cased; 6IN = 6 inch casing; PQ = PQ size casing; SLOT = Slotted casing
Refer to parent group for definition of WGPG_TOOL, WGPT_PARA.
Where the heading has no unit the WGPT_UNIT data variable shall be set to "UNITLESS ."""@en ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://gitlab.com/AGS-DFWG-Web/ASG4/-/blob/710b1f08097264e6508be1397282aece79278fc4/AGS4/AGS4_2/4_2_0/groupsandheadings4-2-0.json> ;
