    skos:altLabel "ELRG"@en ;
    skos:definition "Environmental Laboratory Reporting"@en ;
    skos:historyNote """Group status: New
AGS 4.1: Group Added - Replaces ERES
AGS 4.1: Headings Added - LOCA_ID, SAMP_TOP, SAMP_REF, SAMP_TYPE, SAMP_ID, SPEC_REF, SPEC_DPTH, ELRG_CODE, ELRG_METH, ELRG_MATX, ELRG_RTYP, ELRG_TADE, ELRG_TICN, ELRG_RUNI, SPEC_DESC, SPEC_PREP, SPEC_BASE, ELRG_LSID, ELRG_RTCD, ELRG_IQLF, ELRG_LQLF, ELRG_RVAL, ELRG_RTXT, ELRG_NAME, ELRG_TNAM, ELRG_DCAT, ELRG_TESN, ELRG_FDEV, ELRG_DEV, ELRG_RRES, ELRG_DETF, ELRG_ORG, ELRG_RDLM, ELRG_MDLM, ELRG_QLM, ELRG_DUNI, ELRG_CASC, ELRG_TICP, ELRG_TICT, ELRG_RDAT, ELRG_SGRP, ELRG_DTIM, ELRG_TEST, ELRG_TORD, ELRG_LOCN, ELRG_BAS, ELRG_DIL, ELRG_LMTH, ELRG_LDTM, ELRG_IREF, ELRG_ITYP, ELRG_SIZE, ELRG_PERP, ELRG_REM, ELRG_LAB, ELRG_CRED, TEST_STAT, FILE_FSET
AGS 4.1: Group Rule Added - • Where there is no unit, the ELRG_RUNI data variable shall be set to 'UNITLESS'. • When reporting Tentatively Identified Compound (TIC) data variables the ELRG_CODE shall be P4100""" ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary> ;
