    skos:altLabel "LOCA"@en ;
    skos:definition "Location Details"@en ;
    skos:historyNote "AGS 4.1: Group Rule Added - • For the transfer of proposed exploratory locations, the designer shall use the LOCA group with LOCA_STAT = 'PROPOSED', noting that the LOCA group does not accommodate both proposed and as-built data for a single position (such as co-ordinates), this is considered a data management issue." ;
